er your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000260/extras/4d242c12bebc7ac5a54659640c9921e2.poster.avif?t=1733251087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000260/extras/4d242c12bebc7ac5a54659640c9921e2.webm?t=1733251087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000260/extras/4d242c12bebc7ac5a54659640c9921e2.mp4?t=1733251087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
